    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled within the highly sought-after The Casino development, this superb ground floor apartment enjoys a wonderfully private and secluded position within a small, exclusive block. Behind secure vehicular and pedestrian gates, this beautifully presented home offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation just a short stroll from Malahide Village, with direct pedestrian access beside Malahide railway station and the entrance to Malahide Castle & Gardens only moments away.\n\nThe accommodation begins with a welcoming entrance hallway featuring attractive semi-solid timber flooring and a conveniently located hot press. The hallway leads through to the an open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, thoughtfully designed with a subtle separation between each space.\n\nThe bright living room enjoys semi-solid timber flooring and is enhanced by a striking curved feature wall incorporating two large windows, flooding the room with natural light. Adjacent is a dedicated dining area, comfortably accommodating a four-seater dining table, with double doors opening onto a private balcony, providing the perfect spot to enjoy a morning coffee or relax outdoors.\n\nThe well-appointed kitchen features an excellent range of wall and floor-mounted units, granite worktops and a full selection of integrated appliances including a fridge freezer, mini dishwasher, oven, hob, extractor fan, microwave, washing machine and dryer.\n\nThere are two well-proportioned bedrooms. The principal bedroom is a generous double complete with extensive fitted wardrobes, while the second bedroom is ideal as a small double, guest bedroom or home office and also benefits from built-in wardrobes.\n\nThe fully tiled bathroom is finished to a high standard and comprises a bath with overhead shower and glass shower screen, WC, wash hand basin, heated towel rail and a recessed mirror with integrated downlighters.\n\nSet within one of Malahide`s most desirable developments, this exceptional apartment combines privacy, security and convenience, with every amenity on your doorstep. From boutique shops, cafés and restaurants to coastal walks, Malahide Castle & Gardens, and excellent transport links, this is a rare opportunity to acquire a home in an outstanding location.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\nWith wood flooring\n\nUtility - 1.33m (4'4\") x 0.91m (3'0\")\n\nOpen Plan Living / Dining / Kitchen\nWood flooring to the living and dining space, tiled floor in the Kitchen.\n\nLiving Room - 6.14m (20'2\") x 4.51m (14'10\")\nSpacious living area with feature fire as a focal point, two large windows, wood flooring.\n\nDining Area - 2.34m (7'8\") x 2.61m (8'7\")\nSituated off the Living area with access to both the Kitchen and the patio.\n\nKitchen - 2.44m (8'0\") x 2.3m (7'7\")\nRange of gloss floor and wall units, built in microwave, oven, stainless steel hob and stainless steel extractor over. Integrated fridge/freezer, dishwasher and washing machine, tiled floor.\n\nPatio - 3.61m (11'10\") x 2.5m (8'2\")\nOut side space off the dining area for alfresco dining.\n\nBedroom One - 3.5m (11'6\") x 4.38m (14'4\")\nWith built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom Two - 2.26m (7'5\") x 4.08m (13'5\")\nWith built in wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 2.32m (7'7\") x 1.78m (5'10\")\nFully tiled with suite comprising bath with shower attachment, glass shower screen, pedesteal wash hand basin, WC, heated towel rail.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Exclusive ground floor apartment in a small, private block </li><li> Prestigious gated The Casino development </li><li> Bright open-plan living, dining and kitchen accommodation </li><li> Private balcony accessed from the dining area </li><li> Two well-proportioned bedrooms with fitted wardrobes </li><li> Gas-fired central heating </li><li> One designated parking space with ample guest parking </li><li> Secure pedestrian access directly beside Malahide railway station </li><li> Just a short stroll to Malahide Village and directly opposite Malahide Castle & Gardens</li></ul>"
      },
